ted and unremarkable  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes A F with representative sections of the cavity in cassettes A D and uninvolved parenchyma in cassettes E F  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  JOSHUA B  KISH  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  W B Jerry Younger  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  RE EXCISION , Negative.
